# Does Machines: "Gain the next level as a sorcery to add its ability" (CR 716.2, 716.3). Level 2 is not gained on the
# opponent's turn (turn 2, with the mana untapped: the sorcery timing refuses it), is gained on Bot1's own turn 3 (the
# positive control), level 3 is not available at level 1, and level 2 is not available again at level 2. With no artifact
# card in the graveyard (the loot milled and discarded Islands), "up to two target artifact cards" has no target: the
# trigger is put on the stack with none and nothing is asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Does Machines
Island x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Does Machines.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Does Machines.Activate(Ability: Level 2)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Does Machines.Activate(Ability: Level 3)
Bot1.Battlefield.Does Machines.Activate(Ability: Level 2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Does Machines.ClassLevel = 2
! Bot1.Battlefield.Does Machines.Activate(Ability: Level 2)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Does Machines.ClassLevel = 2
